  from (values
    ('728a63c6-8282-5cf3-91c6-90578935883d'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-micro-wind-turbines',
     'A photo of your diary pages or chart.',
     'Observe from the ground or indoors; stay off roofs and away from power lines.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-micro-wind-turbines), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Micro wind turbines harness natural wind to generate electricity. They can operate independently or be connected to a centralized electricity grid, and are useful for small-scale commercial, agricultural, and residential applications. Advantages include reducing reliance on fossil fuels for electricity generation, potential expansion of electrification to rural areas, and improvement in energy equity and independence worldwide.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-micro-wind-turbines', null, null, null),
    ('1bd34e77-5d56-532f-8989-77f1bde20630'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-nuclear-fusion',
     'A link or photo of your explainer with sources listed.',
     'Stick to reputable sources and avoid hype or scary claims you can''t back up.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-nuclear-fusion), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Nuclear fusion combines two elements in a nuclear reaction to form a larger element and release energy that can be used to generate electricity. Nuclear fusion has been researched since the 1950s, but there have been no nuclear fusion plants built to date.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-nuclear-fusion', null, null, null),
    ('9f545890-788e-5ce4-b6ce-042251b8d441'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-small-modular-nuclear-reactors',
     'Your summary with links to the regulator''s records.',
     'Use the regulator''s public records and public meetings only, and don''t approach nuclear or industrial sites.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-small-modular-nuclear-reactors), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Small modular nuclear reactors (SMRs) are advanced reactors designed to produce low-carbon electricity using smaller units that are factory-fabricated. SMRs aim to overcome the safety, cost, and scalability challenges of traditional large-scale nuclear power. They offer benefits such as passive safety systems, lower capital investment, and the potential to be deployed flexibly in remote or underserved regions.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-small-modular-nuclear-reactors', null, null, null),
    ('f364102d-e11f-583a-8249-e8ce07615a75'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-advanced-geothermal-energy',
     'A link to your video, slideshow or comic with sources listed.',
     'Stick to reputable sources, and don''t visit drilling or plant sites.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-advanced-geothermal-energy), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Advanced geothermal energy is an emerging clean energy technology that harnesses the Earth’s subsurface heat to generate emissions-free baseload and dispatchable electricity and heat.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-advanced-geothermal-energy', null, null, null),
    ('1ba35152-acfa-5786-8eb7-015bfa01c232'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-methane-digesters',
     'A short summary with links, or a screenshot of your question and any reply, with names and contact details hidden.',
     'Use public information or official tours only, and never enter treatment plant grounds or go near tanks on your own.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-methane-digesters), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Methane digesters are specialized devices that use anaerobic digestion to convert agricultural, industrial, or municipal organic waste into biogas and digestate, a nutrient-rich material. Treating organic waste using a methane digester reduces emissions by capturing methane that would have been released during uncontrolled anaerobic decomposition in a landfill or manure lagoon.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-methane-digesters', null, null, null),
    ('3fb16043-b210-577e-b662-670cb9df0296'::uuid, 'drawdown-improve-district-heating-industry',
     'A screenshot of your question and any reply, with names and contact details hidden, plus links to the plans you checked.',
     'Use official channels and public documents, and don''t visit industrial sites.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-district-heating-industry), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Improving district heating for industry involves using low-carbon alternatives, such as electric boilers, heat pumps, and waste heat from other industries, to provide heat to industries for their operations. Currently, most district heating for industry relies heavily on fossil fuels to generate heat (International Energy Agency [IEA], 2026).',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-district-heating-industry', null, null, null),
    ('29222f7a-28ca-54ba-970f-bbef5c525b0f'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-plastic-alternatives-bioplastics',
     'A photo or link to your post or sign with the official source named.',
     'Use the official local guidance, put up signs only where you have permission, and don''t sort through anyone else''s bins.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-plastic-alternatives-bioplastics), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Bioplastics are renewable, plant-based alternatives to conventional plastics that can reduce emissions by replacing fossil-based feedstocks with biogenic carbon feedstocks. These feedstocks are biomass materials that absorb atmospheric CO₂ during growth and serve as the carbon source for plastic production.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-plastic-alternatives-bioplastics', null, null, null),
    ('940d2140-eb2f-58dc-b798-4ffc96fff671'::uuid, 'drawdown-improve-steel-production',
     'A photo or link to your timeline with sources listed.',
     'Research only; don''t visit mills, scrapyards or industrial sites.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-steel-production), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Improve Steel Production involves replacing the use of fossil fuels in making steel from iron ore with electrolytic hydrogen and clean electricity.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-steel-production', null, null, null),
    ('154bc628-8758-51ed-924a-1dd61ed2e171'::uuid, 'drawdown-reduce-airplane-contrails',
     'A photo of your sky diary or sky photos with your notes.',
     'Never look at the sun or point a camera straight at it, and watch from a safe place on the ground.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/reduce-airplane-contrails), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Contrails, the long, thin clouds that form behind airplanes, trap heat radiating from the Earth, creating a strong but short-lived warming effect similar to that of GHGs in the atmosphere (Kärcher, 2018; Thomas et al., 2025). Rerouting airplanes to avoid areas where warming contrails can form reduces the warming impact of these human-made clouds (Martin Frias et al., 2024).',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/reduce-airplane-contrails', null, null, null),
    ('4a35883c-a97e-5422-bd31-c5a6e4763554'::uuid, 'drawdown-mobilize-green-hydrogen-for-aviation-and-trucking',
     'A photo or link to your chart with sources listed.',
     'Present both sides fairly, and don''t handle fuels or gas containers.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/mobilize-green-hydrogen-for-aviation-and-trucking), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Green hydrogen is an emissions-free fuel produced by using renewable electricity to split water into hydrogen and oxygen. For aviation and long-haul trucking, green hydrogen can be used either directly in fuel cells or combusted in modified engines, offering a potential pathway to deep emissions reductions.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/mobilize-green-hydrogen-for-aviation-and-trucking', null, null, null),
    ('12db7169-9d11-5a35-988c-d58c8d0a3c86'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-sustainable-aviation-fuel',
     'Your summary with links to the airline statement and the independent sources.',
     'Quote sources accurately, stick to what they say, and don''t accuse anyone of wrongdoing.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-sustainable-aviation-fuel), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Sustainable aviation fuel (SAF) is a low-carbon alternative to conventional jet fuel. It is made from renewable feedstocks, including waste oils, agricultural residues, and renewable electricity. However, when combustion emissions are considered, SAF does not consistently reduce emissions when compared to conventional fuels. SAF is already in use in commercial flights at low blending levels.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-sustainable-aviation-fuel', null, null, null),
    ('0f2c4e86-82a9-5e77-9998-68ddb3c337fa'::uuid, 'drawdown-advance-cultivated-meat',
     'A short, anonymous summary of the answers you gathered.',
     'Ask only willing people, keep answers anonymous, and don''t pressure anyone.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/advance-cultivated-meat), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Cultivated meat is produced from a sample of animal cells, rather than by slaughtering animals. This technology shows promise for reducing emissions from animal agriculture, but its climate impact depends on the energy source used during production.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/advance-cultivated-meat', null, null, null),
    ('22458ffa-9f2e-5a40-b72f-921a3a09b5a0'::uuid, 'drawdown-use-feed-additives',
     'A link to your video, comic or post with sources listed.',
     'Don''t give advice on feeding animals, and stick to what reliable sources say.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/use-feed-additives), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Feed additives can reduce enteric methane production in ruminant livestock, such as cattle, goats, and sheep. Most feed additive compounds are still being researched to determine their efficacy and safety; however, at least one product, 3-NOP (3-nitrooxypropanol), has been shown to be effective, has recently been approved for use in many countries, and has experienced some early adoption.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/use-feed-additives', null, null, null),
    ('a67c7c74-c7f6-55fc-b546-3ea4b959745a'::uuid, 'drawdown-improve-irrigation-water-use-efficiency',
     'A photo of your rain jar and your week of notes.',
     'Keep the jar on the ground rather than on a roof or ledge, and empty it after each reading so mosquitoes can''t breed.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-irrigation-water-use-efficiency), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Irrigation water use efficiency involves reducing water use without compromising crop productivity by improving irrigation scheduling and/or equipment. Irrigation produces GHG emissions by altering biogeochemical cycling of carbon and nitrogen cycles in water and soils, and through energy use for pumping.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-irrigation-water-use-efficiency', null, null, null),
    ('f9085849-2b32-5436-8bbe-99e52ed4e57b'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-leaf-protein-concentrates',
     'A photo or link to your fact sheet with sources listed.',
     'Research and explain only; don''t forage, process or eat wild plants, and don''t give nutrition advice.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-leaf-protein-concentrates), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Deploying leaf protein concentrates (LPCs) involves isolating high-quality proteins from green foliage, agricultural by-products, or aquatic flora for use in human food and animal feed.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-leaf-protein-concentrates', null, null, null),
    ('f3e231f6-139d-504b-952e-b7deb39f9422'::uuid, 'drawdown-improve-ruminant-breeding',
     'Your summary with a link to the talk.',
     'Use free public talks or university pages, and don''t visit farms without an invitation.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-ruminant-breeding), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Ruminant livestock, such as cattle, goats, and sheep, can be selectively bred for reduced enteric methane production.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/improve-ruminant-breeding', null, null, null),
    ('ffc85842-a7a4-5629-a9c1-8b41a58eb5c1'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-seaweed-farming-for-food',
     'A photo of your dish and the recipe with your source.',
     'Buy seaweed sold as food rather than collecting it, and check allergies and dietary limits before sharing.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-seaweed-farming-for-food), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Deploy Seaweed Farming for Food involves cultivating seaweed (often called macroalgae) in the ocean for human consumption as a partial replacement for low-protein foods grown on land (e.g., grains, vegetables). This solution considers the emissions avoided by substituting one kilogram of low-protein food with one kilogram of seaweed.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-seaweed-farming-for-food', null, null, null),
    ('93e0f0e8-0fe4-59f7-907f-05ac7287a250'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-alternative-grazing',
     'Your summary with links to any published guides, or a summary of the reply you received, without the advisor''s name or contact details.',
